#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:46
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "摘要"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:49
msgid ""
"This example uses Comfy Research to reproduce the central experiment in "
"the left panel of Figure 1 from Jastrzębski et al.: whether cyclic batch "
"size (CBS) and cyclic learning rate (CLR) produce similar training "
"dynamics. This is a qualitative reproduction; it does not claim point-by-"
"point or numeric replication of the paper's curves."
msgstr ""
"本示例使用 Comfy Research 复现 Jastrzębski 等人 Figure 1 左图的核心实验：循环批量大小（CBS）与循环学习率（CLR）是否产生相似的训练动态。这是一项定性复现，并不主张逐点或数值上复现论文曲线。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:56
msgid ""
"**Paper:** [Three Factors Influencing Minima in "
"SGD](https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.04623)"
msgstr ""
"**论文：** [Three Factors Influencing Minima in "
"SGD](https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.04623)"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:58
msgid "**Template:** `repro: Jastrzębski Fig 1 cyclic CBS vs CLR`"
msgstr "**模板：** `repro: Jastrzębski Fig 1 cyclic CBS vs CLR`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:60
msgid "**Template ID:** `repro-jastrzbski-fig1-vgg11`"
msgstr "**模板 ID：** `repro-jastrzbski-fig1-vgg11`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:62
msgid "Reproduction Goal"
msgstr "复现目标"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:64
msgid ""
"The paper studies the relationship between learning rate, batch size, and"
" the final point reached by SGD. The authors focus in particular on the "
"ratio of learning rate to batch size:"
msgstr "论文研究学习率、批量大小与 SGD 达到的最终点之间的关系。作者尤其关注学习率与批量大小之比："

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:68
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\eta}{B}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\eta}{B}\n"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:72
msgid ""
"where $\\eta$ is the learning rate and $B$ is the batch size. The left "
"panel of Figure 1 compares two periodic training strategies:"
msgstr "其中 $\\eta$ 是学习率，$B$ 是批量大小。图 1 左图比较两种周期训练策略："

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:75
msgid ""
"**CBS:** Keep the learning rate fixed and change the batch size "
"periodically."
msgstr "**CBS：** 保持学习率固定，周期性改变批量大小。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:76
msgid ""
"**CLR:** Keep the batch size fixed and change the learning rate "
"periodically."
msgstr "**CLR：** 保持批量大小固定，周期性改变学习率。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:78
msgid ""
"The two experiments use matching ranges of $\\eta/B$. Similar overall "
"accuracy trajectories would support the paper's qualitative observation "
"that, in this experimental setting, a learning-rate schedule can be "
"replaced by a matching batch-size schedule."
msgstr "两项实验使用匹配的 $\\eta/B$ 范围。相似的整体准确率轨迹将支持论文的定性观察：在该实验设置中，学习率调度可以由匹配的批量大小调度替代。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:83
msgid "Paper Experiment and Reproduction Boundary"
msgstr "论文实验与复现边界"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/jastrzebski-fig1-cyclic-cbs-vs-clr.md:85
msgid ""
"The current template represents the VGG-11 with Batch Normalization "
"experiment on CIFAR-10 from the left panel of Figure 1. It retains the "
"CBS-versus-CLR comparison and aggregates results over five initialization"
" seeds."
msgstr ""
"当前模板对应 Figure 1 左图的 CIFAR-10 上 VGG-11 with Batch Normalization 实验，保留 CBS 与 CLR"
" 的比较，并汇总五个初始化 seed 的结果。"

