" dynamics. It does not provide per-epoch numeric errors, confidence "
"intervals, or pixel-level alignment with the original figure, so its "
"conclusions remain qualitative."
msgstr "本复现检验两种调度是否产生相似的训练动态。它不提供逐 epoch 的数值误差、置信区间或与原图的像素级对齐，因此结论仍仅具定性意义。"

